    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/faf55e2b5076c542d0809a3b8e713169.avif?t=1741976385\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 years old, introverted, and socially awkward in real life. However, he is a well-known humorist in the online world under his anonymous identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled in software and game development, possessing both technical and creative abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate about game projects, particularly those integrating innovative ideas such as mental technology and gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/18b812e2565e680fe8ea672b1a7a9a0c.poster.avif?t=1741976385\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/18b812e2565e680fe8ea672b1a7a9a0c.webm?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet Friend:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone Gabe met anonymously online but has built trust with over the years, known only by the alias &quot;Null.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they are working on a game project focusing on mental connection technology. However, some features remain unexplored as the project is still untested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabe and Null have developed a prototype device (a headgear capable of transmitting electronic brainwave signals) that enables players to connect to the game. This system allows players to control in-game characters solely through mental focus, without the need for physical controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.poster.avif?t=1741976385\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.webm?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.mp4?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Dynamics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Players must solve a series of complex puzzles and action-packed missions to progress through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Advanced aliens equipped with high technology and robots with diverse abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps: Mazes, brain-teasers, and mechanisms requiring precise timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges: Limited lives, attention-demanding mechanics, and increasingly difficult levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitches and Bugs: As the game is still in the prototype stage, it contains various glitches. These errors may disrupt the game's logic or even put Gabe in danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/faf55e2b5076c542d0809a3b8e713169.avif?t=1741976385\" data-has-big width=800 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gabe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 years old, introverted, and socially awkward in real life. However, he is a well-known humorist in the online world under his anonymous identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skilled in software and game development, possessing both technical and creative abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passionate about game projects, particularly those integrating innovative ideas such as mental technology and gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/18b812e2565e680fe8ea672b1a7a9a0c.poster.avif?t=1741976385\" width=540 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/18b812e2565e680fe8ea672b1a7a9a0c.webm?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Internet Friend:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone Gabe met anonymously online but has built trust with over the years, known only by the alias &quot;Null.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they are working on a game project focusing on mental connection technology. However, some features remain unexplored as the project is still untested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gabe and Null have developed a prototype device (a headgear capable of transmitting electronic brainwave signals) that enables players to connect to the game. This system allows players to control in-game characters solely through mental focus, without the need for physical controllers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.poster.avif?t=1741976385\" width=800 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.webm?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387660/extras/4826977cb1adfe50771a0b0cbfddc119.mp4?t=1741976385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Dynamics:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective: Players must solve a series of complex puzzles and action-packed missions to progress through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies: Advanced aliens equipped with high technology and robots with diverse abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps: Mazes, brain-teasers, and mechanisms requiring precise timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges: Limited lives, attention-demanding mechanics, and increasingly difficult levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glitches and Bugs: As the game is still in the prototype stage, it contains various glitches. These errors may disrupt the game's logic or even put Gabe in danger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in Your Own Game! Codebound tells the story of a high school student trapped in the game he created. To escape, he must finish it! Along the way, he discovers surprises left by a mysterious friend who helped him. Dive into this pixel-styled world full of puzzles and exciting adventures!",
